cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its measurements, please cite it."
title: "qwen-jev-like: typed decisions from open local models, one forward pass"
abstract: >-
  A re-implementation of a typed-decision contract (yes/no, pick-one, rubric
  score) over open local models, scoring options in a single forward pass
  instead of generating them. Ships the engine, two backends, the calibration
  pipeline, and the measurements with their disclosures.
authors:
  - alias: sting8k
repository-code: "https://github.com/sting8k/qwen-jev-like"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-22"
keywords:
  - structured-output
  - calibration
  - selective-prediction
  - quantization
  - llama.cpp
  - vllm
